sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Speaker
    participant B as Bridge
    participant SX as Soniox
    participant Q as Delay Queue
    participant O as Operator
    participant V as vMix
    participant A as Audience

    Note over S,A: T+0s — speaker says a phrase

    S->>B: audio, live pre-delay tap
    B->>SX: PCM chunk
    SX-->>B: non-final tokens, ~0.5s
    SX-->>B: final + translation tokens, ~1-2s
    B->>Q: line stamped with start_ms

    Note over Q,O: T+2s — line becomes visible to operator

    Q-->>O: pending line, Gujarati + English
    O-->>Q: drop or hold — optional, advisory only

    Note over O: ~28 second review window

    Note over Q,A: T+30s — release deadline

    Q->>V: SetText or overlay update
    V->>A: caption composited onto DELAYED video

    Note over S,A: video of the T+0 speech reaches air at T+30s<br/>caption and video land together
